raw_output:
Here's a sample promotion for the new diaper product in JSON format:

```json
{
  "product_name": "ComfortCare Diaper",
  "tagline": "Wrap your baby in comfort",
  "description": "Introducing the ComfortCare Diaper, designed to provide your baby with the ultimate comfort and protection. Our unique breathable material and ergonomic design ensure a snug and secure fit, while our advanced absorbency system keeps your baby dry and happy.",
  "key_features": [
    {
      "feature": "Breathable Material",
      "description": "Allows for airflow and helps regulate baby's skin temperature"
    },
    {
      "feature": "Ergonomic Design",
      "description": "Contours to baby's body for a snug and secure fit"
    },
    {
      "feature": "Advanced Absorbency",
      "description": "Quickly absorbs and locks away moisture for up to 12 hours"
    }
  ],
  "benefits": [
    {
      "benefit": "Reduces Skin Irritation",
      "description": "Our breathable material and gentle design help prevent skin irritation and diaper rash"
    },
    {
      "benefit": "Promotes Healthy Sleep",
      "description": "Our advanced absorbency system helps keep baby dry and comfortable, promoting healthy sleep patterns"
    },
    {
      "benefit": "Easy to Use",
      "description": "Our simple and intuitive design makes it easy to put on and take off the diaper"
    }
  ],
  "call_to_action": {
    "text": "Try ComfortCare Diaper today and give your baby the comfort they deserve!",
    "url": "https://www.comfortcarediaper.com"
  },
  "special_offer": {
    "text": "Get 20% off your first purchase with code COMFORT20",
    "expiration_date": "2023-12-31"
  }
}
```

This JSON object includes the following information:

* `product_name` and `tagline` to introduce the product
* `description` to provide a brief overview of the product
* `key_features` to highlight the unique features of the product
* `benefits` to explain how the product benefits the customer
* `call_to_action` to encourage the customer to take action
* `special_offer` to provide a limited-time promotion to incentivize the customer to make a purchase

You can use this JSON object to generate a promotion for your new diaper product on your website, social media, or other marketing channels.

